            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Getting Around in Al Gouna"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Al Gouna, a beautiful destination, offers a variety of transportation options for visitors and locals alike, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable travel experience. This guide provides an in-depth look at the available modes of transport, primarily focusing on local buses and tuk-tuks, two of the most popular means to traverse this picturesque town."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Local Buses – The Backbone of Al Gouna's Transport"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The local bus service in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "Al Gouna"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is renowned for its extensive network, covering almost every part of Al-Gouna. This makes it an incredibly convenient option for those looking to "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "explore"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " different areas of the town. An added advantage is the cost-effectiveness of this mode of transport. For just E£50, you can purchase a daily bus pass, allowing unlimited "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "travel throughout the day"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". This is particularly appealing for "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "tourists who wish to visit multiple attractions"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " without worrying about transportation costs. The buses are known for their efficiency, making them a practical choice for both "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "short and longer journeys"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " within Al Gouna."
            }
          ],
