        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For a more "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001a"
              ],
              "text": "localized and personal travel"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " experience, tuk-tuks are a popular choice. These are readily available across the streets of Al Gouna and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001d"
              ],
              "text": "offer a unique"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " way to navigate the town. The cost of a tuk-tuk ride varies, typically ranging from E£30 to E£60, depending on the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000020"
              ],
              "text": "distance of the journey"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Opting for a tuk-tuk ride not only supports local drivers but also provides a more intimate and engaging way to experience the town’s vibrant "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000023"
              ],
              "text": "culture"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and scenic routes."
