            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is both easy and affordable, thanks to its well-connected local bus network and the charming tuk-tuks that add a touch of local flavor to your travels. Whether you opt for the cost-effective and efficient bus "
